---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" class="dark">
  <head>
    <BaseHead 
      title={`About ${SITE_TITLE} - Free Instant Web Games & Tactical Puzzles`} 
      description="Learn about AetherArcade, an independent client-side browser gaming portal dedicated to high-speed, zero-install, free web games." 
    />
  </head>
  <body class="static-page-body">
    <Header />

    <main class="static-page-main">
      <div class="content-container">
        <span class="pill-label">ABOUT AETHERARCADE</span>
        <h1>Free Web Games, Reimagined for the Modern Browser</h1>
        
        <p class="lead-text">
          <strong>AetherArcade</strong> is an independent web gaming platform built with one singular mission: <em>instant, frictionless, and high-quality browser gaming with zero downloads, zero paywalls, and zero waiting.</em>
        </p>

        <hr class="divider" />

        <h2>Our Gaming Philosophy</h2>
        <p>
          Remember when you could click a link and immediately play a fun, clever game in your browser? In an era dominated by 50GB game downloads, mandatory launcher apps, invasive trackers, and predatory in-app purchases, browser games offer pure, unadulterated fun.
        </p>
        <p>
          Every title on AetherArcade is crafted to run <strong>100% client-side</strong>. This means:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Zero Installation:</strong> Games load in under 500 milliseconds. Tap or click and you are playing.</li>
          <li><strong>Cross-Platform by Design:</strong> Whether you are on an iPhone, Android, MacBook, Chromebook, or Linux desktop, our games scale to fit your screen with touch and keyboard support.</li>
          <li><strong>Privacy-Respecting:</strong> We do not require accounts, logins, or invasive tracking cookies. Your game progress and high scores are saved directly in your browser's private local storage.</li>
          <li><strong>100% Free Forever:</strong> We do not have micro-transactions or pay-to-win items.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Our Flagship Game: God Duel</h2>
        <p>
          Our featured original title is <strong>God Duel</strong>, inspired by the beloved Japanese and Korean web classic <em>God Field (갓필드)</em>. We wanted to celebrate the strategic depth of turn-based card dueling—where luck, probability calculation, and bluffing meet in rapid 3-minute matches against responsive AI opponents.
        </p>

        <h2>The Tech Behind the Arcade</h2>
        <p>
          AetherArcade is built using modern web standards:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Astro 7:</strong> Delivers lightning-fast, static HTML architecture with zero JavaScript overhead on content pages.</li>
          <li><strong>HTML5 Canvas & Pure TypeScript:</strong> Ensures silky smooth 60fps animations and responsive physics without heavy game engines.</li>
          <li><strong>Web Audio API:</strong> Powers our sound effects entirely via real-time procedural synthesis, meaning zero bulky audio files to download.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Contact & Feedback</h2>
        <p>
          Have a suggestion for a new game, found a bug, or want to say hello? Visit our <a href="/contact">Contact Page</a> or email us directly at <code>support@aetherarcade.com</code>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  .static-page-body {
    background: #090d16 !important;
    color: #f1f5f9 !important;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .static-page-main {
    flex: 1;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem 5rem;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .content-container {
    background: #0f172a;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 2.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .pill-label {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #38bdf8;
    background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #f8fafc;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .lead-text {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .divider {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #f8fafc;
    margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
  }

  p {
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  ul {
    color: #cbd5e1;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  a {
    color: #38bdf8;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  code {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.4rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: #e2e8f0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .content-container {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
    }
  }
</style>